<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Thank you to everyone who attended our neighborhood picnic and brought tasty treats to share. We also want to extend a special thanks to all of our awesome volunteers who helped make the event a success: Bev and Robin Woidy, Dhananjay Singh and his son, Linh Ly, Evelyn Profeta, Tony and Joanne Bugna, Quyen Fitting, Christy and Denny Majchrowicz, Keith Huie, Erika Cramer and her dad, and Rick, Rena and Blake Flovin.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

182 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(We were thrilled to have special guests, including Sunnyvale Mayor Larry Klein, City Manager Tim Kirby, City Council Representative Eileen Le, representatives from California State Assemblymember Patrick Ahrens' office, and representatives from Santa Clara County Supervisor Otto Lee\220s office. A big hit with the kids was having Sunnyvale Public Safety Fire Fighters bring over a fire engine for everyone to check out!)/Pg 8 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

183 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(A huge shoutout goes to our Neighborhood Walmart store at the Mercado shopping center for their generous donation of all the hamburgers and a large supply of water. They are currently renovating their store and invite everyone to their grand reopening on December 19th at 9 AM. Please support the store if you can, as they have been and will continue to be a fantastic supporter of our neighborhood.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

