191 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(We had 49 volunteers come out to support the statewide coastal clean up initiative in our backyard on the Calabazas Creek Trail on Saturday September 20 including local girl and boy scout troops. We collected over 900 pounds of trash and helped to beautify our neighborhood and protect our waterways. A big shout out to all those who came out to help!)/Pg 9 0 R/K[5]>>
