201 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The safety of our community is a top priority, and the Lakewood Village Neighborhood Association \(LVNA\) is working to keep residents informed and engaged. As part of these ongoing efforts, we are pleased to announce that Sunnyvale\220s new Police Chief, Daniel Pistor, will be our special guest at the upcoming LVNA General Meeting at Lakewood Park on Wednesday, October 8, at 7:00 PM.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

202 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Chief Pistor will discuss neighborhood safety priorities, answer your questions, and share his vision for community policing in Lakewood Village. This is a vital opportunity for residents to engage directly with law enforcement leadership, voice concerns, and offer suggestions.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

203 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Don\220t miss this important conversation! Mark your calendar for October 8 at 7 PM. Your participation is crucial in shaping a safer Lakewood Village.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

