249 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 549 0 R/E(Block party hosts: All you need is to find a date that works, fill out a 1pg reservation with the city, make flyers to invite neighbors, make it a potluck, and set up a table. And you may even get to know your neighbors a bit more and find commonalities. The goal is to form stronger bonds, building a community that cares and looks out for each other. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[17]>>
